{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-2483","published":"2026-05-29T11:11:26Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:20:00.846615455Z","upstream":["CVE-2025-43023","CVE-2026-8631","CVE-2026-8632"],"summary":"hplip security update","details":"The Hewlett-Packard Linux Imaging and Printing Project provides drivers for HP printers and multi-function peripherals.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nA potential security vulnerability has been identified in the HP Linux Imaging and Printing Software documentation. This potential vulnerability is due to the use of a weak code signing key, Digital Signature Algorithm (DSA).(CVE-2025-43023)\n\nA potential security vulnerability has been identified in the HP Linux Imaging and Printing Software. This potential vulnerability may allow escalation of privileges and/or arbitrary code execution via an integer overflow in the hpcups processing path when handling crafted print data.(CVE-2026-8631)\n\nA potential security vulnerability has been identified in the HP Linux Imaging and Printing Software. This potential vulnerability may allow escalation of privileges and/or arbitrary code execution via operating system command injection.(CVE-2026-8632)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"hplip","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP3","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/hplip&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.26.4-1.oe2403sp3"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["hplip-3.26.4-1.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","hplip-debuginfo-3.26.4-1.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","hplip-debugsource-3.26.4-1.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm"],"src":["hplip-3.26.4-1.oe2403sp3.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["hplip-3.26.4-1.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","hplip-debuginfo-3.26.4-1.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","hplip-debugsource-3.26.4-1.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-2483.json"}},{"package":{"name":"hplip","ecosystem":"openEuler:20.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/hplip&distro=openEuler-20.